      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, hurry up the order already!' Kostya rushes the kitchen line during service.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Гость за пятым столиком ждёт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The guest at table five is waiting.' Kostya says the customer at five is waiting.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
