      "t": "Всё готово, можешь забирать блюдо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything is ready, you can take the dish.' Barinov tells him to grab the finished meal.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Отлично, несу в зал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Great, taking it to the dining room.' Kostya grabs the plate for the main floor.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Стой, секунду, подожди меня здесь!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, one second, wait for me here!' Barinov stops him right there for a moment.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Шеф, мне надо сейчас работать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, I need to work right now.' Kostya points to his busy dining room duties.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Костя, скажи, как твои дела?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kostya, tell me, how are your affairs?' Barinov asks about his life in general.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Нормально, чаевые сегодня хорошие.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fine, tips are good today.' Kostya mentions his successful shift at the tables.",
